# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if have platform-specific dependencies, which can result in locking issues.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, it is generally recommended to commit poetry.lock to version control.
#   For library projects, it is ideal to not commit poetry.lock.
#   Reference: https://python-poetry.org/docs/basic-usage/#commit-your-poetrylock-file
# poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, it is generally recommended to commit pdm.lock to version control.
